@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Graphic Design Assessment

skinparam BackgroundColor transparent

skinparam DefaultFontSize 30

skinparam DefaultFontStyle bold

actor User

participant "Web Browser" as Browser
participant "Flask Application" as Flask
participant "Authentication" as Auth
participant "Upload Module" as Upload
participant "Computer Vision" as CV
participant "AI Models" as AI
participant "Assessment & Scoring" as Score
participant "Feedback Module" as Feedback
database "SQLite Database" as DB

User -> Browser : Login
Browser -> Flask : Submit Login Details
Flask -> Auth : Verify Credentials
Auth -> DB : Retrieve User
DB --> Auth : User Account
Auth --> Flask : Authentication Result
Flask --> Browser : Dashboard

User -> Browser : Upload Graphic Design
Browser -> Flask : Send Image
Flask -> Upload : Validate & Save Image
Upload -> DB : Store Design Information

Upload -> CV : Pre-process Image
CV -> CV : Extract Visual Features
CV --> Upload : Visual Features

Upload -> AI : Send Image / Features
AI -> AI : Perform AI Analysis
AI --> Upload : AI Analysis Results

Upload -> Score : Send Analysis Results
Score -> Score : Evaluate Design Principles
Score -> Score : Calculate Quality Score

Score -> Feedback : Send Scores & Weaknesses
Feedback -> Feedback : Generate Recommendations

Feedback --> Flask : Feedback & Results
Flask -> DB : Save Assessment
Flask --> Browser : Display Results
Browser --> User : View Score & Feedback

@enduml